# Personal Job Match & Interview Prep Studio

Streamlit application for evaluating resume-to-job alignment, HR & People Analytics readiness, Normal Distribution performance positioning, 6-axis competency radar, skill coverage heatmaps, interview talking points, and Indeed Easy Apply search links.

## Run Locally

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
streamlit run app.py
cd $HOME\Documents\resume_matcher_app

@'
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
.streamlit/secrets.toml
